      "value": "@{5a7466e1210f3722d556b9ab|full_name}: With the current setup, you should have the same parameters list on Quest/PC. Nothing wrong with ignoring some parameters. At the moment a bool is 1 bit, while the other two options (int/float) are 8 bits but I'd recommend getting those right just in case",
